      "en": "It rains a lot in the Netherlands."
    },
    {
      "id": "NN24b-A02",
      "nl": "In de herfst is het nat en donker.",
      "zh": "秋天又湿又暗。",
      "en": "In autumn it is wet and dark."
    },
    {
      "id": "NN24b-A03",
      "nl": "De zomer is heerlijk.",
      "zh": "夏天真好。",
      "en": "Summer is lovely."
